<html>
  <head>
    <title>Giga Blocks Email Verification</title>
    <link
      href='https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Sans&display=swap'
      rel='stylesheet'
    />
  </head>
  <body
    style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif; background-color: #f9fafb; padding: 40px 20px; display: flex; justify-content: center;"
  >
    <div style='max-width: 900px;'>

      <!-- Header -->
      <div style='background-color: #000000; color: #ffffff; padding: 24px; text-align: center;'>
        <h1 style='font-size: 24px; margin:0'>Giga Blocks</h1>
        <h3 style='font-size: 32px; margin:10px 0;'>Verify Your Email Address</h3>
        <p style='font-size: 14px; margin:0'>Confirm your identity to continue with Giga Blocks</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Main Content -->
      <div style='padding: 32px 0;'>
        <div style='text-align:center'>
          <h3 style='font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px;'>You're almost there!</h3>
          <p style='font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;'>
            Let's verify your email to complete your journey with Giga Blocks and support Giga's
            initiative.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Verification Box -->
        <div
          style='background:#F4F4F4 ; border-radius: 12px; margin: 32px 0; padding: 24px; text-align: center;'
        >
          <p style='font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px;'>Ready to continue?</p>
          <p style='font-size: 14px; color: #555;'>
            Click the button below to verify your email address and ensure a secure experience while
            supporting global education.
          </p>

          <!-- Button -->
          <a
            href='{{link}}'
            style='display: inline-block; background-color: #316bff; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; margin:10px 0; font-family: sans-serif;'
          >
            Verify My Email Address
            <svg
              xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'
              width='16'
              height='16'
              fill='white'
              style='vertical-align: middle; margin-left: 8px;'
              viewBox='0 0 24 24'
            >
              <path d='M14 3h7v7h-2V6.41l-9.29 9.3-1.42-1.42 9.3-9.29H14V3z' />
              <path
                d='M5 5h4V3H5c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v4h2V5zM19 19h-4v2h4c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2v-4h-2v4zM5 19v-4H3v4c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h4v-2H5z'
              />
            </svg>
          </a>

          <p style='font-size: 12px; color: #888;'>This link will expire in 1 hour for security
            purposes.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Security Notice -->

        <div
          style='font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 24px; display: flex; border:1px solid #E0E0E0; padding:16px; border-radius:12px;'
        >
          <div style='margin:2px 6px 0 0;'><svg
              xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'
              width='16'
              height='16'
              viewBox='0 0 24 24'
              fill='none'
              stroke='currentColor'
              stroke-width='2'
              stroke-linecap='round'
              stroke-linejoin='round'
              class='lucide lucide-shield-icon lucide-shield'
            ><path
                d='M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z'
              /></svg></div>
          <div>
            <strong>Security Notice:</strong>
            This email was sent to
            <a href='mailto:{{email}}' style='color: #316bff;'>{{email}}</a>
            because someone initiated an email verification on Giga Blocks. If this wasn't you, feel
            free to ignore this message — no action is needed, and the link will expire
            automatically.</div>
        </div>

        <!-- What happens next -->

        <div
          style='font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 24px; display: flex; border:1px solid #E0E0E0; padding:16px; border-radius:12px;'
        >
          <div style='margin:2px 6px 0 0;'><svg
              xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'
              width='16'
              height='16'
              viewBox='0 0 24 24'
              fill='none'
              stroke='currentColor'
              stroke-width='2'
              stroke-linecap='round'
              stroke-linejoin='round'
              class='lucide lucide-clock-icon lucide-clock'
            ><path d='M12 6v6l4 2' /><circle cx='12' cy='12' r='10' /></svg></div>
          <div>
            <strong>What happens next? </strong>
            Once you click the verification link, you'll be redirected to Giga Blocks where you can
            continue your activity.</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Trouble Section -->
        <div
          style='font-size: 14px; border:1px solid #E0E0E0; padding: 16px; border-radius: 12px; line-height: 1.6;'
        >
          <p><strong>Having Trouble?</strong></p>
          <div style='font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 24px; display: flex; border-radius:12px;'>
            <div style='margin:2px 6px 0 0;'><svg
                xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'
                width='16'
                height='16'
                viewBox='0 0 24 24'
                fill='none'
                stroke='currentColor'
                stroke-width='2'
                stroke-linecap='round'
                stroke-linejoin='round'
                class='lucide lucide-triangle-alert-icon lucide-triangle-alert'
              ><path
                  d='m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3'
                /><path d='M12 9v4' /><path d='M12 17h.01' /></svg></div>
            <div>
              <strong>Button not working?</strong>
              <p style='margin: 0 0 5px;'>Copy and paste this URL into your browser:</p><p
                style='margin: 0; background: #F1F2F3; padding: 5px 10px'
              >{{link}}</p></div>
          </div>
          <div style='font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 24px; display: flex; border-radius:12px;'>
            <div style='margin:4px 6px 0 0;'><svg
                xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'
                width='16'
                height='16'
                viewBox='0 0 24 24'
                fill='none'
                stroke='#525252'
                stroke-width='3'
                stroke-linecap='round'
                stroke-linejoin='round'
                class='lucide lucide-mail-icon lucide-mail'
              ><path d='m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7' /><rect
                  x='2'
                  y='4'
                  width='20'
                  height='16'
                  rx='2'
                /></svg></div>
            <div>
              <strong>Didn't request this?</strong>
              <p style='margin: 0 0 5px;'>No worries! Simply ignore this email. The link will expire
                automatically in 1 hour</p></div>
          </div>
          <div style='font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 24px; display: flex; border-radius:12px;'>
            <div style='margin:4px 6px 0 0;'><svg
                xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'
                width='16'
                height='16'
                viewBox='0 0 24 24'
                fill='none'
                stroke='#525252'
                stroke-width='3'
                stroke-linecap='round'
                stroke-linejoin='round'
                class='lucide lucide-clock4-icon lucide-clock-4'
              ><path d='M12 6v6l4 2' /><circle cx='12' cy='12' r='10' /></svg></div>
            <div>
              <strong>Link expired?</strong>
              <p style='margin: 0 0 5px;'>Return to the Giga Blocks website and request a new
                verification email.</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Footer CTA -->
      <div style='margin-top: 40px; text-align: center;'>
        <p>Want to Learn More About Giga Blocks?</p>
        <div style='margin: 2rem 0;'>
          <a
            href={{aboutLink}}
            style='margin: 4px; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #d1d5db; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px; color: #111; font-weight:900; '
          >About the Giga Initiative</a>
          <a
            href='https://giga-blocks.com/how-it-works'
            style='margin: 4px; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #d1d5db; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px; color: #111; font-weight:900; '
          >How It Works</a>
          <a
            href={{schoolList}}
            style='margin: 4px; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #d1d5db; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px; color: #111; font-weight:900; '
          >Browse All Schools</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Footer -->
      <div
        style='margin-top: 32px; font-size: 13px; color: #888; background: #F4F4F4; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 1rem; text-align: center;'
      >
        <p>Need Help?
          <a href='https://giga.global/contact-us/' style='color: #316bff;'>Help Center</a>
          |
          <a href='mailto:{{emailurl}}' style='color: #316bff;'>Email Support</a></p>
        <hr />
        <p style='margin-top: 2.5rem;'><strong>Giga Blocks</strong><br />A project by UNICEF's Giga
          Initiative to connect every school to the internet.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>